    {
      "path": "/projects/3/description",
      "value": "ABO - MCH is a multi-feature application, where the Client service teams can input and track the trades status as SWIFT instruction process. Additional approval step is required for Cash and Security transactions due to regulatory and business reasons. Project will benefit include replacing fax based manual instructions by SWIFT based STP leading to reduced operational risk and reduced processing time. MCH provides all the transaction details to the user. The user can find both the cash payment SWIFTs (MT202/MT103/MT210) & trade SWIFT proprietary message type called MT messages (MT-54x, MT-56x series).",
